litesurf

litesurf is an independent Node.js adapter for Kitesurf. It is not an official
Cloudflare package. Its runtime loader is adapted from Kitesurf's
scripts/wpt-engine.mjs, Copyright (c) 2026 Cloudflare, Inc., under Apache-2.0.
The Node.js API, CLI, build orchestration, and packaging are maintained here.

The Kitesurf engine source is kept unmodified in the upstream/kitesurf Git
submodule. Its generated Worker, WebAssembly, and public assets are distributed
under dist/. See dist/upstream.json for the exact source revision and
dist/licenses/ for upstream notices, license texts, and the source Cargo locks.

Release tarballs also include dist/licenses/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt and
dist/licenses/SOURCE_AVAILABILITY.txt. The latter identifies the accompanying
source archive, including the exact patched MPL-2.0 dependency sources.
